### ClaimCheckPlayground — Processor API Test Requests
### Run the Aspire AppHost first, then update the port numbers and claim token below.
### Copy a claimToken value from a successful POST /orders response (Producer).

@ProcessorBaseUrl = https://localhost:49954

# Replace the token below with a real value from POST /orders
@ClaimToken = 84b8617dc4b74e34a10c2697157c1361

# ── Poll order status ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Expected: 200 OK with status: pending | processing | fulfilled | failed
# Poll every few seconds after submitting an order to watch the lifecycle.
GET {{ProcessorBaseUrl}}/orders/{{ClaimToken}}/status

###

# ── Unknown claim token ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Expected: 404 Not Found
GET {{ProcessorBaseUrl}}/orders/00000000000000000000000000000000/status

###
